        ((Z^d)^F.m) σ t*polynomial (F.family u F.label) false ((logProfile^[k]) positiveAnnular)
        ((Z^d)^F.m) σ t‖^2;
      value≤C*(1+height)^Jheight*(Z^d)^(max 1 (2*F.m)+D.t) ∧
